"── Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
"  :conn, :connect <profile>  Connect to a profile                                                                                                               "
"  :set <setting>=<value>     Change a setting                                                                                                                   "
"  :help, :h                  Keyboard help                                                                                                         F1 / Space ? "
"  :run                       Run statement under cursor                                                                                                  Ctrl+E "
"  :cancel                    Cancel running query                                                                                                        Ctrl+C "
"  :quit, :q                  Close the tab (on the last tab: quit)                                                                                              "
"  :qall, :qa, :quitall       Quit                                                                                                                        Ctrl+Q "
"  :w, :write [<name>]        Save (a console asks for a name; with a name: save as)                                                          Ctrl+S / Space s s "
"  :wq, :x [<name>]           Save, then close the tab (on the last tab: quit)                                                                Ctrl+S / Space s s "
"  :tabnew                    New console tab                                                                                                 Ctrl+T / Space t n "
"  :tabclose                  Close tab                                                                                                       Ctrl+W / Space t c "
"  :recover                   Bring back a closed console (also from earlier runs)                                                                               "
" COMMAND  : type a command or an action name                                                                               Tab/↑↓ select · Enter run · Esc close"
